### Get Invoice by ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/invoice/1

### Get all Invoices
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/invoice

### Lookup Invoices
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/invoice/lookup

### Create Invoice
POST https://localhost:5001/api/biller/invoice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "InvoiceNumber": "Sample",
  "IssuedToContactID": 0,
  "CompanyID": 0,
  "InvoiceDate": "Sample",
  "PaymentRef": "Sample",
  "InvoiceStatusID": "Sample",
  "Tenant": "Sample",
  "IssuedToContact": "Sample"
}

### Update Invoice
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/biller/invoice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "InvoiceNumber": "Sample",
  "IssuedToContactID": 0,
  "CompanyID": 0,
  "InvoiceDate": "Sample",
  "PaymentRef": "Sample",
  "InvoiceStatusID": "Sample",
  "Tenant": "Sample",
  "IssuedToContact": "Sample"
}

### Delete Invoice
DELETE https://localhost:5001/api/biller/invoice/1
